{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":43,"ref":"numbers 7:43","book":"numbers","lang":"tw","chapter":7,"translation":"Nɔkɔseɛ no: sikakɔkɔɔ anum mmienu — deɛ ɛdi kan, adekyerɛ sika (kɔkɔɔ) baako a emu duru yɛ sikle ɔha ne aduasa; sika (kɔkɔɔ) nsuo-ayamyie baako a emu duru yɛ sikle aduɔson wɔ asɔredan sikle mu; ne baanu no nyinaa ahintow a wɔde ngo abom ama afɔdeɛ.","tokens":[{"surface":"קרבנו","gloss":"nɔkɔseɛ no"},{"surface":"קערת","gloss":"adɛkyerɛ"},{"surface":"כסף","gloss":"sikakɔkɔɔ"},{"surface":"אחת","gloss":"baako"},{"surface":"שלשים","gloss":"aduasa"},{"surface":"ומאה","gloss":"ne ɔha"},{"surface":"משקלה","gloss":"a emu duru yɛ"},{"surface":"מזרק","gloss":"nsuo-ayamyie"},{"surface":"אחד","gloss":"baako"},{"surface":"כסף","gloss":"sikakɔkɔɔ"},{"surface":"שבעים","gloss":"aduɔson"},{"surface":"שקל","gloss":"sikle"},{"surface":"בשקל","gloss":"wɔ ... sikle mu"},{"surface":"הקדש","gloss":"asɔredan"},{"surface":"שניהם","gloss":"ne baanu no"},{"surface":"מלאים","gloss":"ahintow"},{"surface":"סלת","gloss":"ɛmo"},{"surface":"בלולה","gloss":"a wɔde abom"},{"surface":"בשמן","gloss":"ngo"},{"surface":"למנחה","gloss":"ama afɔdeɛ"}],"timestamp":"2026-09-15T21:26:58.940122294Z","model":"glm-5.3"}